 1: # OCR Dataset Builder
 2: 
 3: ## Setup
 4: 
 5: 1. Add your Mistral API key to `.env`
 6: 
 7: 2. Copy all ROI images into
 8: 
 9: ```
10: dataset/all_roi_images
11: ```
12: 
13: 3. Run
14: 
15: ```
16: python run.py
17: ```
18: 
19: The pipeline will
20: 
21: - Process the first 1000 images
22: - Send them to Mistral OCR
23: - Save OCR output to `annotations.csv`
24: - Move processed images to `completed/`
25: 
26: Run it again to process the next batch.
