 36: 
 37: ## Features
 38: 
 39: - **PDF Ingestion & Rendering**: Renders PDF pages to high-resolution images via PyMuPDF (`fitz`).
 40: - **Deskewing**: Automatically estimates and corrects page rotation and skew angles.
 41: - **Vertical Line Detection**: Extracts margin vertical separation lines to isolate annotation zones.
 42: - **ROI & Margin Cropping**: Crops target text margins and extracts region-of-interest (ROI) annotation blocks.
 43: - **Image Preprocessing**: Enhances contrast (CLAHE, morphology, binarization, denoising) for high-accuracy OCR.
 44: - **Annotation Detection & Masking**: Detects handwritten/typed margin annotations and offers masking capabilities.
 45: - **Modular OCR Engines**: Pluggable backend support including **LM Studio** local Vision LLMs and HuggingFace **TrOCR**.
 46: - **Dataset Builder Suite**: Automated AI-assisted dataset labeling pipeline powered by Mistral AI API integration.
 47: - **Research Tools**: Utilities for dataset preparation, benchmarking preprocessing techniques, and evaluating OCR performance metrics.
