152: - [src/annotation_remover.py](file:///g:/OCR_codes/src/annotation_remover.py): Removes or masks detected annotations from page images using morphological mask operations.
153: - [src/config.py](file:///g:/OCR_codes/src/config.py): Defines global pipeline settings and execution parameters via the `PipelineConfig` dataclass.
154: - [src/cropper.py](file:///g:/OCR_codes/src/cropper.py): Crops specific document page regions based on detected vertical separator line coordinates.
